     "Selected L11/SAFE8 checked Core consumes actual ordered Core, early solved type and inferred/checked effect products, scoped grants and profile/provider/runtime support, then the actual capture/race/transfer/synchronization safety decisions. Early candidate Core and solved type products precede combined legality; the exported checked Core follows it. Preserve child/cleanup edges, source/default atomic order, schemas, replay obligations and all four safety outcomes. A safe flag, support descriptor or declaration cannot substitute for an analysis decision, and final runtime or whole suite acceptance is not a prerequisite for constructing or checking Core. Additional provider checked Core consumes real solved capability types, inferred effects, derived grants, profile/provider/isolation/trust decisions and gate obligations, preserving selected identities and origins. Candidate source/Core facts precede these combined decisions. Export checked Core only with real legal outcomes; a declaration, requested grant, signature or supplied passed field cannot establish them. Actual runtime action traces are later consumers, not prerequisites for forming the operation's checked contract. Additional L12 checked Core consumes actual computed values/generated candidate Q and ordinary resolved/type/effect/grant/profile/safety products. Early Q construction precedes those decisions and the later generated-program equivalence result; exported checked Core follows them. Preserve target-representation, phase and origin facts, invalidating changed assumptions. Meta/plugin generation cannot bypass checks, and no later Runtime action or whole suite is needed to form a legal checked operation. Additional joint macro checked-Core integration uses early candidate Q followed by actual ordinary type/effect/grant/profile/memory/safety decisions and immutable origin-preserving artifacts. Actual generated conformance then consumes the checked result; do not require its own final comparison as the input candidate. Keep runtime effects independent from P build authority and retain unsafe/proof/check metadata and refusals. Additional complete C3 semantic handoff consumes actual source/generated context and applicable lifecycle decisions while integrating real Types/Effects/Legality results. Initial Core construction uses earlier syntax operations; actual later owner facts are attached and revalidated at their proper phase. Carried metadata cannot invent completed analysis or authority, and source/consumer conformance follows actual products.",
