ance behavior with actual definition/call/generated context. Additional complete C3 safety boundary consumes actual verified syntax/origin/hygiene/phase records and applicable fresh semantic facts, preserving proof obligations as obligations. Legality computes the governing four outcomes; Syntax does not create a proof or unsafe authorization. Reject stale or fabricated safety facts and keep actual proof/certificate requirements at their claimed boundary, without mandatory replacement proof admission for ordinary syntax. Complete L2/C6 safety admission classifies actual dangerous operations against current type/effect/ownership/profile and applicable proof/check/audit facts. Preserve proven-safe, runtime-checked, rejected or explicit unsafe-island outcomes without backend undefined behavior or an implicit fifth result. Core expression/control/effect/panic/refusal behavior is not this safety classification. Required runtime checks and failure semantics survive into actual later MIR/lowering/execution products. Complete L5/C7 cast/raw-pointer/dynamic safety classification consumes actual conversion/type facts and current ownership/profile/proof/check/audit premises. Preserve proven-safe, runtime-checked, rejected or explicit unsafe-island outcomes and required safe API/audit metadata. Type classification alone is not proof, installed runtime enforcement or permission for actual held foreign/native/provider actions.",
