t inputs stay separate. Consumers preserve permitted/internal-only versus safe-export eligibility, every island and dependency summary, exact source identities and stale/expired/wrong-scope refusals. Actual external review, signing and publication retain their authority; this route grants none. Additional SAFE2-SAFE5 final composition consumes actual C14 ABI/layout and target-matched provider decisions, Backend verified-input/proof-target/emitted-memory metadata results, and Runtime linked/loaded service agreement in addition to existing real memory/startup/check/cleanup/transfer results. Reconcile derived layout, field/range/padding/packing/ABI/address-space and provider identities with the earlier typed analysis and every surviving proof/check assumption; changed layouts or providers require valid preservation or invalidation/reanalysis and a retained legal check or refusal. Lowering cannot legalize an earlier rejection or attach noalias/dereferenceable/alignment from a declaration. Demonstrate checks before access, initialized-only drop, at-most-once region cleanup and exactly-once linear cleanup/transfer across every modeled exit under declared failure/unwind/cancellation policy. Preserve region/generation/reset and concurrent/foreign/device transfer facts, source/generated/debug origins and actual diagnostic identities. These are final selected-boundary results after legal analysis and verified MIR, never whole Lower/Backend/Runtime completion or a new allocation/execution gate before local analysis. Additional L10/L18 preservation consumes actual checked allocation/memory/volatile/MMIO/atomic/barrier ordering from its Effects owner along with the existing MIR/Opt/Lower/Runtime products. Reconcile provider/layout/source and proof assumptions at actual allocation/release/transfer/check boundaries; invalidate/recheck changed facts and retain a legal check or refuse. Actual public library consumers feed family conformance later, rather than becoming a prerequisite