     "Additional provider type boundary supplies actual capability id, provider contract, scope, phase, lifetime, thread-safety and revocation facts from source/declarations before combined legality. Passing/storing a capability as data need not perform its eventual effect. Type correctness never proves grant issuance, allowed scope use, successful provider startup or full C7 acceptance; selected schema shapes precede actual codecs where serialization is used. Additional L12 type handoff supplies real early solved P expression/callable/capability/allocation/capture and fixed target-query facts before evaluation. Later consume actual constants/generated Q and owner solutions for Q's ordinary type/representability and invalidation result. Type-level evaluation and generated protocol/schema cases cannot require Q's own final type/layout result as their earlier input. Keep target ABI rules distinct from derived Q layout, and current C7 publication/whole-source acceptance unaltered; supplied type names or passed flags do not prove values or grants. Additional joint macro type handoff exposes real available P/expected-type facts where an engine uses them, then checks actual Q with ordinary solutions and representability/invalidation. Earlier typed-engine rejection must match or improve a later required diagnostic, while effect/authority/memory/profile/safety checks remain. A type-shaped syntax record is not a solved fact or full C7 acceptance; preserve current C7 restrictions. Additional complete C3 type-fact handoff consumes actual serialized solutions/layout requirements and owner invalidation conditions from Types4, valid syntax-derived references and real Syntax lifecycle decisions. Types retains solving, semantic freshness and regeneration; Syntax retains carrier/transform invalidation. Preserve source/profile/ownership/effect references and reject stale facts before downstream use. Early source syntax verification does not depend on its later typed result. Additional complete L3/C5 type handoff uses actual resolved/verified bindings, selected legal imports/graph and current namespace definition/type records. Retain real solved type/protocol/call identities and separate inferred versus declared facts before Effects/Legality/MIR. Reject stale exports, substituted bindings and inconsistent module/checker facts; an early namespace map is not final type or authority acceptance. Complete L2/C6 typed handoff attaches actual current solutions, function latent/error/capability contracts, call/dispatch/capture and explicit dynamic/layout/schema records to verified candidate Core before Effects/Legality. This early typed product is not final profile/safety acceptance or the same subject's future checked Core. Reject missing, stale or inconsistent node facts, retaining source/generated and primitive diagnostic context. Complete L5/C7 typed verification checks the actual entire current subject: exactly one type or diagnostic per node, every constraint solved or rejected, full function latent/thrown/capability/ownership/profile records, all nontrivial cast records, profile-marked dynamic boundaries, authentic source schema links, required actual layouts and preserved origins. Verify full artifact round-trip and reject missing, stale or coherently substituted nodes, solutions, callers, transfer/layout/schema dependencies and diagnostics. Available ABI/schema/checker contracts precede their actual selected products; early typed expressions may feed layout/query derivation before final typed verification. Verification precedes Effects claiming legality; actual Effects/Auth/profile/ownership/safety acceptance follows the early typed handoff and precedes checked Core/MIR. A supplied type map, assigned solved/passed status, nonempty table or quoted verification contract proves none of these operations. Complete L7 typed verification checks actual narrowed branch environments, scrutinee/pattern compatibility, guard normal Bool or non-returning transfer, coverage/domain and authentic validation links with current source references. This typed gate precedes Effects claiming legality; later actual effect/profile/ownership decisions and final checked-tree composition remain distinct. Verify/read back actual complete attached facts and reject missing, stale or coherently substituted products; no field-presence or expected-result table is a semantic verdict. Complete L8 typed verification first validates actual independent type contracts and tentative dispatch inputs for effect analysis. Later full checked-dispatch composition validates actual method compatibility, visible effects, separate grants and profile/host/schema facts after owner results arrive. Do not require final effect admission to construct its own preliminary typed call graph, or accept a complete container as nine-field compatibility and seven diagnostic detection.",
