s the input candidate. Keep runtime effects independent from P build authority and retain unsafe/proof/check metadata and refusals. Additional complete C3 semantic handoff consumes actual source/generated context and applicable lifecycle decisions while integrating real Types/Effects/Legality results. Initial Core construction uses earlier syntax operations; actual later owner facts are attached and revalidated at their proper phase. Carried metadata cannot invent completed analysis or authority, and source/consumer conformance follows actual products. Additional complete L3/C5 checked-Core composition consumes the actual selected namespace/module graph and current type/effect/profile/authority summaries before MIR/target use. Earlier Core construction can use actual declaration/binding products without inventing those later facts. Reject inconsistent module and checker products, retaining every source/generated diagnostic and the unresolved D1/C1/C5/C6 representation qualification. Complete L2/C6 checked-Core export consumes actual structurally verified candidate, solved current types, ordered/conservative effects, separate grants, profile/ownership/safety verdicts and applicable domain checker/anchor products. Declaration/seed-only construction precedes these computations. Source-anchored domain checking can precede this export; later MIR/target anchor completion follows actual MIR/lowering and is not its own first checked-Core premise. Preserve real latent/call/error/mutation and generated facts, proof/check/reject/audited-unsafe outcomes and all source artifacts. Runtime support contracts may precede checking; actual execution and owner examples follow. No backend or runtime legalizes a rejected source program. Complete L5/C7 checked-Core composition consumes the actual verified current type subject and affected dependency regeneration together with real effect, grant, profile, ownership and safety verdicts. Keep declaration-bearing candidate Core and structural verification before inference. Final type facts preserve actual compatibility and inference premises; source-checking records do not legalize missing grants or unsafe behavior, and the same future checked export is not the solver's first input. Complete L7 checked composition joins actual current decision tree, exhaustive/unreachable cases, narrowing table, branch-effect summary, applicable validation links and move/borrow facts after the owning analyses. Keep all seven artifacts/eight diagnostics and current origins. Checked export precedes selected target lowering; later representative backend conformance witnesses the task's claimed consumer behavior and is not an input to its first export. Defaults or a typed guard cannot waive safety proof, grants or validation. Complete L8 checked export joins actual compatible method/implementation selection, visible effects, separate grants, profile/resource verdicts and required host/schema boundary facts for the exact source. Final target layouts/emitted/runtime/conformance behavior follow this export; early interface/service contracts suffice before compilation. No source example, table presence or provider name grants admission.",
