creation effects after relaxation, incomplete inputs and secret leakage refuse reuse. Pipeline integrates facts/results without duplicating machinery. Additional complete C3 cache result uses actual semantic syntax identities, complete selected serialized subjects and real producer-conditioned invalidation/currentness decisions before a hit or dependent artifact use. Apply stage-specific owner and current-policy revalidation; reject stale syntax, facts, origin diagnostics or proofs rather than trusting timestamps, hashes alone or current flags. Preserve permitted engine-specific machinery under shared Build policy. No repeated external action authorizes a cache hit, and source-only cache subjects do not require later semantic products they do not contain. Additional complete L3/C5 cache reuse consumes actual semantic binding/module identities and producer-owned affected invalidation/recheck decisions for all nine resolution causes. Only facts present in the selected cache subject require their actual owner products; source-only caches do not wait for later type or checked-module facts they do not contain. Semantic-id stability under docs/formatting does not permit stale physical origins, diagnostics, public API or policy. Preserve permitted engine machinery and actual current-policy admission; hashes or current flags alone are insufficient. Complete L2/C6 cache reuse binds actual source/desugaring rule/graph/schema/profile/semantic-policy inputs and producer-owned invalidation to the selected cache stage. Early syntax/Core-only entries do not await later analyses or execution absent from their subject; typed/MIR/optimized entries require the actual included facts and current affected rechecks. Reject stale rule, source/generated diagnostics, node/table/anchor or proof assumptions; equivalent values or stable semantic ids cannot authorize stale provenance. Complete L5/C7 cache reuse binds actual selected type rules, source/binding/caller/use/visibility/export/escape/mutation/original-transfer/compatibility, schema, target/profile and producer dependencies to cached products. Changed premises invalidate affected type/effect/dispatch/layout/diagnostic consumers and require real owner recomputation. Source-only entries need no absent later types, while typed/MIR entries cannot reuse stale origins, omitted private census or coherently substituted solutions under stable semantic ids. Complete L7 caching binds real selected rule/constructor/domain/guard/order/binding/type/effect/resource/schema/profile/target and source-origin conditions. Changes invalidate actual affected narrowing/coverage/decision/diagnostic products and require genuine owner regeneration before reuse. Source-only caches need no absent later analyses; stable semantic ids, equal output values or copied checked fields permit no stale provenance.",
