e/generated identities, partial initialization, arena reset, borrow escapes, cancellation, cleanup failure and invalidated-proof cases remain explicit. Feed the existing Release suite and independent admission afterward; no reverse final-release prerequisite or library/source acceptance follows from this declaration. Additional complete L10/L18 family results preserve all 21 source diagnostic meanings and actual accepted/refused regime/provider/replacement/init/borrow/region/linear/forget/foreign/device/MMIO/proof-invalidation and API/service cases. Consume real selected primitive/lowering/effect/provider/runtime/library and target results through the declared producer chains. Independently supplied review is required for a governed stable weakening, not for ordinary unchanged-contract fixtures; its adoption result is not a reverse prerequisite here. Existing Release execution and later independent admission remain separate, and source declarations alone confer none of this implementation evidence.",
