ched artifact. Emit Input hashes and reused/rebuilt node/cache-decision log with changed key field and PKG2002. Dependencies: PKG2, PKG7, C16. Decision allocation interface/compiler/c16/dependency-invalidation (Open). Role: build cache/invalidation maintainer. Invalidate downstream artifacts on every specified source/macro/namespace/type/effect/profile/capability/safety/proof/provider/target/backend/package/policy/facet/diagnostic change; record exact affected revalidation stages. Refusals and conditional cases: Change source, reader option/extension, macro/dependency, grant/replay, namespace import/export/alias, package version, type/provider, effect/capability registry, profile, safety/proof/trust, pass contract, target/backend, runtime/provider, facet or diagnostic schema; reject stale reuse and record each affected downstream revalidation stage. Required outputs: Field-sensitive dependency graph, complete change-class invalidation trace and clean-versus-revalidated artifact/diagnostic comparison. Consume actual dependency interface outputs: resolve/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/resolve4-publish-stable-indexes, pipeline; whole-component completion is not a prerequisite. Retain exact source/compiler/pass/profile/target and checker/provider identities, actual positive products and refused-case diagnostics. Implementation acceptance remains unassessed.\n<!-- build-canonical-cache-conditions:end -->\n\n\n<!-- build-canonical-incremental-records:start -->\nApply the [complete incremental-compilation source criteria](plan.md#complete-incremental-compilation-source-criteria) within this existing task. Status remains Open; current independent review and implementation acceptance are pending. Existing criterion fragments remain in place.\n\nC16 incremental graph/record/diagnostic criterion (Open): The actual incremental graph contains source units, syntax streams, expansion traces, namespace analysis, typed core, effect and ownership graphs, safety outcomes, MIR, op