wrapper preconditions and inspect the underlying audit evidence; fail leaked unsafe states or absent boundary tests/audits. Retain actual input/output and diagnostic identities plus positive and rejected-case artifacts; supplied success flags, proposal delivery and broad parent links are not executable evidence. This producer supplies conformance evidence; independent intermediate admission and final release remain separate consumers. Current implementation acceptance is unassessed.",
